  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rjf1](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rjf1) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 82.098 depth occurred on Oct 25 2025 71 km S of Severo-Kuril’sk, Russia. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 50.0304 longitude 156.1104. It impacted 169 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
